r ultimate garden. Stay tuned for weekly updates!\n\n**\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf3e How to Play**\n- Buy a seed and grab it\n- Place it in your garden\n- Wait and watch it grow\n- Harvest and earn BIG\n\nRemember, your garden literally grows while you\u2019re offline! \u2b50\ufe0f", "short_description": "\n# \ud83c\udf31 Welcome to Bwah - Grow a Garden in VR \ud83c\udf31\nGrow plants, sell for profit, and build your dream garden! Hunt rare seeds, unlock wild mutations, and flex your ultimate garden. Stay tuned for weekly updates!\n\n**\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf3e How to Play**\n- Buy a seed and grab it\n- Place it in your garden\n- Wait and watch it grow\n- Harvest and earn BIG\n\nRemember, your garden literally grows while you\u2019re offline! \u2b50\ufe0f"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/bwah/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ENVER", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/bwah/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "28608615935401823"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595129854_2078605206355350_7778904552272068289_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zz7AaWt4T9UQ7kNvwFadwt0&_nc_oc=AdpxB_9uYFc1F4UoW88u5P-fZQwhO8HhHca7YvJaxjQ5TX0